# TODO

Status: updated after the audit pass. Items marked [DONE] are implemented and
covered by tests; the rest are real, still-open work.

## Open

- [ ] Need to add a cli based graph (Agent_Plugins)
- [ ] Some ports are still hardcoded defaults: mitm-proxy :8080, agent :9000,
      gateway :8765, brain publishes 7010->7000. OLLAMA_HOST, AGENT_HOST,
      AGENT_PORT, AGENT_GATEWAY_*, ANTHROPIC_MODEL and FOX_TASK_DB_PATH are
      already overridable by env. FOX_API_TOKEN is required in the environment
      for the protected Brain/File Manager API (sent as the X-API-Token
      header); without it every protected endpoint fails closed with 401.
- [ ] Cli still calls `os.system('clear')` before each menu redraw; if a
      terminal does not support it the menu reprints over itself.
- [ ] `File_Manager/modify_files.py::delete_file` still deletes permanently
      (Vault-scoped). The Fox Club pipeline has trash/restore through
      agent/fox/runtime/executor.py; the Vault HTTP API (/files/delete) has
      no trash. Reuse that trash implementation rather than writing a second
      one.
- [ ] `brain/Dockerfile` previously copied only app.py, orchestrator.py,
      tools.py and task_store.py, so the image could not import its own app.
      Fixed: root build context copies brain/, File_Manager/, agent/ plus the
      lazily imported Memory/, Finance_bot/, bot.py, Path_mapper.py; user data
      (Vault, file_index.db, user_profs.json) is excluded via .dockerignore.
      Still needs one live `docker compose up` run to verify (no Docker engine
      in this environment; covered by static layout-import tests meanwhile).
- [ ] Phone: message listing is not implemented (kdeconnect-cli has no
      option). D-Bus conversations plugin is the possible path.

## Done

- [DONE] Tools.py: brain/tools.py now delegates finance_calculate and
      schedule_view to the agent-side registry instead of returning
      "In Progress" placeholders (test/test_brain_tools.py).
- [DONE] Phone permission system is enforced (require_permission at the CLI
      entry point, PhonePermissionDenied), not just displayed
      (test/test_phone_enforcement.py).
- [DONE] Phone isolation boundary is enforced from phone_cli.main() and from
      KDEConnectBridge (construction and every call).
- [DONE] Misleading "daemon isn't responding" message, blank `devices`
      output, and the hub panel's false "read from the phone" claim fixed.
- [DONE] Fox Club runtime no longer roots its executor at the repo directory
      (target_dir unset -> Fox Space).
- [DONE] ANTHROPIC_MODEL is env-configurable; duplicate CURRENT_PROVIDER
      removed; task store DB path overridable (FOX_TASK_DB_PATH).
- [DONE] Dead files removed: utils.py (empty), no_heart_script.py (unused
      and broken: `set.root` in __init__).
- [DONE] stress_test.py imported _UnavailableExecutor from the wrong module
      (2 tests failed before reaching their assertions).
